    "updated_at": "2026-11-08T23:20:54Z",
    "body": "Fixed in 10f3ecf: an edge or outside-corner probe (negative expected value) wrote a doubled sign (`#190=#100--2`, `R90=R50--2`). The sign is now folded into the operator (`#190=#100+2`), the same fix PathPilot Hub forced on the Tormach post (PR #376, 6e246c8). Pinned by `{haas,mazak,sinumerik}_edge_deviation_folds_its_sign`; the bore-centre goldens are unchanged. Fanuc has the same bug on main: #377.",
